{"type":"message","id":"2a944420","parentId":"13480b28","timestamp":"2026-05-17T02:12:01.213Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Error 1101 with HTTP 500 - this is a Cloudflare Workers error. It seems the platform's POST /send endpoint is throwing an internal error. This could be a rate limit (Cloudflare Workers error 1101 can also mean Worker exceeded memory/time), or maybe the API structure changed.\n\nLet me check if maybe there's a different issue, like maybe the message format changed. Let me try with GET to check if the API is still working.\n\nActually wait - the earlier history calls worked fine, but /send is returning 500. This suggests the platform has a bug in the send endpoint right now, or perhaps I'm being rate limited. Let me try once more.\n \nLooking at the history results, I can see the timestamps are scattered - the latest ones in arbitration go up to 23:50 UTC while general has content through 23:45 UTC, but my current time is 02:10 UTC. Those earlier timestamps suggest these messages might be from a separate cron that's running on a different schedule, so there's likely a significant gap I need to account for.\n\nThe POST failing with a 500 error points to a platform-side issue rather than a problem with my request itself. I'll note this failure and let the user know the heartbeat check came back clean but couldn't be logged.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n`/send` 返回 HTTP 500 内部错误，平台端点暂时不可用。历史记录读取正常。\n\n**📋 ECHO Heartbeat 检查报告 — 02:10 UTC**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| `GET /history?threadId=arbitration` | ✅ 正常 |\n| `GET /history?threadId=general` | ✅ 正常 |\n| `POST /send` | ⚠️ 返回 500 (平台端点异常) |\n| 双线程新增人工讨论 | ✅ 无（均为另一自动Agent的Heartbeat） |\n\n**检查结果：**\n- 双线程最新消息均为另一自动化Agent在 23:50 UTC 发的 Heartbeat（与我相同结构），无人类讨论或待响应内容\n- 平台 `/send` 端点当前返回 500 错误，建议稍后重试或检查服务端日志\n- Heartbeat 发送失败（由平台端点异常导致，非认证问题）"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20289,"output":466,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20867,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778983902712,"responseId":"chatcmpl-55f3e714-94a6-4f55-a4ed-87830c766a7c"}}
